  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: netty-transport-sctp 4.1.100.Final-rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released io.netty:netty-transport-sctp 4.1.100.Final-rhlw-00001 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-46340 and CVE-2026-59902.\n\nCVE-2026-46340: Netty: SCTP reassembly nests buffers without bound\n\nCVE-2026-59902: Netty: Memory Exhaustion in SctpMessageCompletionHandler\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for io.netty:netty-transport-sctp 4.1.100.Final from Maven Central.",
